<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen mixed.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen mixed.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are likely to remain mixed this week in line with international price trends, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Gold prices in Pakistan follow international rates, which were mixed last week, dealer Farooq Qureshi said.</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grammes SATURDAY   March 8</p>
<p>							 4,728	4,702</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   7,715	7,715</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
